
Server init.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['Database test'], linja-ġdida.

>> db := Maria-DB ġdid host: ['localhost'],
	isem-utent: ['xo'], 
	password: ['pass123'],
	isem-database: ['xobase'],
	qabbad.

>> parametri-tfittxija :=
db mistoqsija: ['SELECT UNHEX('CAFE') AS blobby'],
ġib: { :row
	Ħruġ ikteb: ( row blobby minn: 0 tul: 2 ), linja-ġdida.
	row blobby eħles.
}.
